{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `chosen_action`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: moved the use of parameter `beta` so that its built-in prior sampling statement `beta ~ lognormal(0, 0.75)` occurs before any model-block use of `beta`. The local helper `logits` was inlined in the categorical likelihood as `beta * utility`. This preserves the same posterior/log density. The data are unchanged.
","model_safe_stan":"// ForestDB translation: Blue-eyed Islanders
data {
  int<lower=1> A;
  int<lower=1> N;
  array[N] int<lower=1, upper=A> chosen_action;
  vector[A] utility;
}
parameters {
  real<lower=0> beta;
}
model {
  beta ~ lognormal(0, 0.75);
  chosen_action ~ categorical_logit(beta * utility);
}
generated quantities {
  simplex[A] action_prob = softmax(beta * utility);
}
","data_safe_json":"{"A":5,"N":4,"chosen_action":[4,2,3,1],"utility":[3.3985112484454807,5.945301148414899,2.6263002627515215,3.7802470576378773,5.070102182422051]}","protected_variables":["chosen_action"]}
